  "format_version": 1,
  "description": "Hand-authored vocabulary for synthetic Truenumber datasets. This is generator input, not TN statements or a formal TN grammar.",
  "usage_notes": [
    "Categories organize vocabulary; they are not required TN classes or an ontology.",
    "Combine a subject term and a reference name or code, for example ship Aurora, relay Kestrel or pipe P-0042.",
    "Reference names are interchangeable across categories. Add a code when necessary to distinguish instances.",
    "Reuse complete subject phrases as unquoted phrase values to connect facts. Reuse existing entities deliberately rather than inventing every value independently.",
    "Property applicability, numeric ranges, graph structure and sampling weights belong to the future generator.",
    "Tags describe whole facts and can overlap across categories. No TN parser validation has been performed."
