  "unit_usage_notes": [
    "Unit strings are candidate TN spellings, not a verified parser unit catalog. Validate against the target TN installation before ingest.",
    "Use property_quantity_map to select a quantity and then units_by_quantity to select a compatible unit.",
    "Properties in ambiguous_numeric_properties require a context choice; do not randomly mix their alternative quantities.",
    "An empty unit string means a bare number; emit no unit suffix. Efficiency is a fraction from 0 to 1, and counts are nonnegative integers.",
    "Absolute temperature uses kelvin to avoid offset conversion ambiguity.",
    "Use tonnes for metric mass; avoid the ambiguous spelling tons.",
    "Alternative units describe the same quantity. Convert magnitudes when changing units on an existing fact; do not merely replace the suffix.",
    "Numeric scale words such as million are multipliers rather than physical quantities. Currency conversion is outside this vocabulary."
  ]
